msgstr "Datenbank-Backup"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:290
msgid "Back up the database and regular files below the WordPress root."
msgstr ""
"Sichert die Datenbank und reguläre Dateien unterhalb des WordPress-"
"Stammverzeichnisses."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:291
msgid ""
"Back up all current-site database tables, including WooCommerce HPOS tables."
msgstr ""
"Sichert alle Datenbanktabellen der aktuellen Website einschließlich "
"WooCommerce-HPOS-Tabellen."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:300
msgid "Create and verify"
msgstr "Erstellen und prüfen"

#. translators: %s: Backup duration in seconds.
#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:331
#, php-format
msgid "%s seconds"
msgstr "%s Sekunden"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:341
msgid "Verified at creation"
msgstr "Bei Erstellung geprüft"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:342
msgid "Archive changed"
msgstr "Archiv verändert"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:353
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Herunterladen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:358
msgid "Restore database only"
msgstr "Nur Datenbank wiederherstellen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:358
msgid "Restore database"
msgstr "Datenbank wiederherstellen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:364
msgid ""
"This overwrites current database data contained in the backup. Site files "
"are not restored."
msgstr ""
"Dadurch werden aktuelle Datenbankdaten überschrieben, die im Backup enthalten "
"sind. Website-Dateien werden nicht wiederhergestellt."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:365
msgid "TIM Backup first creates a full safety backup of the current state."
msgstr ""
"TIM Backup erstellt zuerst ein vollständiges Sicherheits-Backup des "
"aktuellen Zustands."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:368
msgid "I understand and want to restore the database from this backup."
msgstr "Ich habe dies verstanden und möchte die Datenbank aus diesem Backup wiederherstellen."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:370
msgid "Restore database now"
msgstr "Datenbank jetzt wiederherstellen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:375
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Löschen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:380
msgid "Permanently delete this backup?"
msgstr "Dieses Backup dauerhaft löschen?"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:383
msgid "I understand that this archive cannot be recovered."
msgstr ""
"Ich habe verstanden, dass dieses Archiv nicht wiederhergestellt werden kann."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:385
msgid "Delete permanently"
msgstr "Dauerhaft löschen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:401
msgid "PHP 8.1 or newer"
msgstr "PHP 8.1 oder neuer"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:402
msgid "PHP ZIP extension"
msgstr "PHP-ZIP-Erweiterung"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:403
msgid "Writable backup storage"
msgstr "Beschreibbarer Backup-Speicher"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:404
msgid "Single-site WordPress"
msgstr "WordPress-Einzelinstallation"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:409
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "Umgebung"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:410
msgid "System checks"
msgstr "Systemprüfungen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:416
msgid "Ready"
msgstr "Bereit"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:416
msgid "Action needed"
msgstr "Handlung erforderlich"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:423
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "Datenschutz"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:424
msgid "Local by design"
msgstr "Bewusst lokal"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:425
msgid ""
"TIM Backup Free does not create an account, track usage, or contact an "
"external service."
msgstr ""
"TIM Backup Free erstellt kein Konto, erfasst keine Nutzung und kontaktiert "
"keinen externen Dienst."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-admin.php:426
msgid ""
"Backup archives remain on this WordPress server until an administrator "
"downloads or deletes them."
msgstr ""
"Backup-Archive bleiben auf diesem WordPress-Server, bis ein Administrator "
"sie herunterlädt oder löscht."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:111
msgid "TIM Backup activation failed"
msgstr "Aktivierung von TIM Backup fehlgeschlagen"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:149
msgid "The backup was created and verified successfully."
msgstr "Das Backup wurde erfolgreich erstellt und geprüft."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:167
msgid "The deletion was not confirmed."
msgstr "Das Löschen wurde nicht bestätigt."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:184
msgid "The backup was deleted."
msgstr "Das Backup wurde gelöscht."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:202
msgid "The restore was not confirmed."
msgstr "Die Wiederherstellung wurde nicht bestätigt."

#. translators: %s: Backup error message.
#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:223
#, php-format
msgid "Restore cancelled because the safety backup failed: %s"
msgstr ""
"Wiederherstellung abgebrochen, weil das Sicherheits-Backup fehlgeschlagen "
"ist: %s"

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:235
msgid ""
"The database was restored successfully. A full safety backup of the previous "
"state was retained."
msgstr ""
"Die Datenbank wurde erfolgreich wiederhergestellt. Ein vollständiges "
"Sicherheits-Backup des vorherigen Zustands wurde aufbewahrt."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:261
msgid "The requested backup could not be downloaded."
msgstr "Das angeforderte Backup konnte nicht heruntergeladen werden."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:299
msgid "TIM Backup Free 0.1.0 does not support WordPress Multisite."
msgstr "TIM Backup Free 0.1.0 unterstützt WordPress Multisite nicht."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:315
msgid "You are not allowed to manage backups."
msgstr "Du bist nicht berechtigt, Backups zu verwalten."

#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:316
msgid "Access denied"
msgstr "Zugriff verweigert"

#. translators: %s: Site name.
#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:376
#, php-format
msgid "[%s] TIM Backup failed"
msgstr "[%s] TIM Backup fehlgeschlagen"

#. translators: 1: Site URL, 2: Error message.
#: includes/class-tim-backup-plugin.php:381
#, php-format
msgid ""
"TIM Backup could not create a backup for %1$s.\n"
"\n"
"Reason: %2$s\n"
"\n"
"Please sign in to WordPress and review TIM Backup."
msgstr ""
"TIM Backup konnte kein Backup für %1$s erstellen.\n"
"\n"
"Grund: %2$s\n"
"\n"
"Bitte melde dich bei WordPress an und überprüfe TIM Backup."

